# Engine layer "sly-amd": amd/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-MXFP4 profiles on the SAME engine layer as sly-redhat
# (Sly 1.9.1, sly-official engine flags: MXFP4 W4A8, fp8 KV, R4D_HYBRID, FULL_DECODE_ONLY graphs).
# Own dir so sly-redhat/ stays the RedHatAI family (SRP); the engine flags are not copied --
# sly-official/_engine.env stays their single source of truth. Only the model family differs here
# (qwen3_5_moe hybrid: 40 layers = 10 full-attn + 30 linear-attn, 256 experts x top-8, hidden 2048).
IMAGE=${IMAGE:-ghcr.io/slybase/vllm-sly-radiance:1.9.1-rocm10.1}
source "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")/../sly-official/_engine.env"
